count":0,"num_stars":0,"is_starred":false,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null},"display_as_bot":false,"has_rich_preview":false,"thumb_800":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F0248KCRW2U-d55035e557/image_800.png","thumb_800_h":646,"thumb_800_w":800,"thumb_tiny":"AwAmADDRo/Cjv1pcH1oAKMUc0UAGKMUUUAH4Un4frR+NA69aAFz7UtFFABRRRQAnNFLRQAmKMUtFACYpaKKAP//Z","username":""}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0hu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bec4f894-9db6-44b7-89a1-031466d1d275","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ありがとうございます。いろいろ試してみます。","ts":"1622471821.421000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D/Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd3f1241-b3b8-4e38-b6e2-6067e7549083","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"おっしゃる感じだとPPPが問題そうなので基本的には「VPN」のタブの\n・「ユーザ認証」\n・「PPP Settings」\nの中をごちゃごちゃする感じになると思います。\n（完全にエスパーになってしまいまい申し訳無いんですが)大体MPPEを使用するかどうかの設定辺りをいじると良さそうです。その辺りをいじりつつnetworkmanagerのログのエラーをひたすらググるとよいのではと思います。","ts":"1622471622.420400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"raised_hands","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xeY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c7f1ca1-e2fb-477b-af48-3989f441a784","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"やってみます!","ts":"1622471228.420200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9z+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e29b78f9-a7e7-4964-bd4e-8d203398ffed","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"OH初歩的なところ見逃してました……。","ts":"1622471223.420000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0eSi9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28be9ea0-dc1b-47fa-94a9-807c7c5bcb9a","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"多分networkmanagerのguiを開いて接続の追加の中にstrongswanの項目があるのでそれを追加する形になるかと思います。","ts":"1622471146.419700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4mJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fb6a9fd-ee99-43d2-9720-ab1cd9d706bd","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"community入りしてるみたいで、そちらをインストール済みです","ts":"1622471010.419600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tSjFu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a4081fd-ddbb-40cd-9b5f-42485d1afa1a","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"networkmanagerなら自分はaurでnetworkmaneger-strongswanを入れて設定しています","ts":"1622470908.419100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NK7+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3394ec6b-c9db-4826-a1c7-77c28d68f0e4","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"繋がりさえすればGUIでさくさくなnetworkmanagerの方がありがたいです。networkmanagerが失敗してたので、xl2tpdとかに手を出してました。","ts":"1622470692.419000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B=lHC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2539a60-5560-4f18-af71-a9843496bc24","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"networkmanagerを使って設定したいんでしたっけ？","ts":"1622470605.418100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NGAU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52b694ae-60fe-4d51-b9ed-8bc4ec799f7e","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"\u0026gt; どうやら、`NetworkManager.conf`の`[keyfile]`セクションに*`unmanaged-devices`*が設定されているためNetworkManagerの管理下にデバイスが入っていない \u003chttps://blog.komeho.info/2020/03/05/19137/\u003e\n```cat /etc/NetworkManager/NetworkManager.conf```\nが空なせいか……？","ts":"1622470551.417900","attachments":[{"fallback":"いつか、そのとき、あの場所で。rev.2: [Ubuntu][NetworkManager] Connection activation failedとなり、NetworkManagerから制御できなかった。","id":1,"title":"[Ubuntu][NetworkManager] Connection activation failedとなり、NetworkManagerから制御できなかった。","title_link":"https://blog.komeho.info/2020/03/05/19137/","text":"そもそもの問題とあるUbuntuがインストールされたArm板で作業していたところ、NetworkManager(nmcli)でデバイスの設定が有効にならない現象に遭遇しました。","image_url":"https://blog.komeho.info/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/1583304972633.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1583383320,"service_name":"いつか、そのとき、あの場所で。rev.2","service_icon":"https://blog.komeho.info/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/favicon.jpeg","from_url":"https://blog.komeho.info/2020/03/05/19137/","original_url":"https://blog.komeho.info/2020/03/05/19137/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WUV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c07b9f75-a633-4ed3-a904-b32e774826eb","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"と思ってxl2pd logで検索してたんですけど、ログの取り方がイマイチ分からず……。\n`systemctl status xl2pd.service`では Connection 0 closed to 192.168.1.1, port 1701 (Timeout)でした","ts":"1622470492.417000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ECj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9fca320-7258-4516-b9fa-5a4301344f51","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"上でおっしゃる通りならxl2tpdをロギングしてエラーの原因っぽいやつを拾うしかないですかね……","ts":"1622470340.415500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mPY5g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0eb3768c-9c71-41a3-ab26-3dc2b346ce16","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"network managerにすると `Connection activation failed`ですね","ts":"1622470204.415300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fbigl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a8e2c8e-72da-4a9f-a736-f6049595d2b8","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"そういえばnetwork-managerではそこ入力してませんでした。\nPhase 1 algorithms: 3des-sha1-modp1024\nPhase 2 algorithms: 3des-sha1\nです","ts":"1622469873.415000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q6m2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb173faa-228c-4e97-a327-1f1fafb19bac","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"多少ならお話伺えるかもです、似たエラーの時は、（network-managerでもそうではなくてもなんですが、)アルゴリズムが対応してなくて駄目だったりしました","ts":"1622469763.414200","edited":{"user":"U01BY3SDBRS","ts":"1622469793.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p2+uU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8e59189-1d79-4f06-9fe0-e1633daee316","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"そういえば諸事情でopenfortivpn使ってたな","ts":"1622469753.414100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QF0PS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9af53eb-5991-42a6-a466-1da2e077ca76","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"もっかい挑戦してみます！","ts":"1622469747.414000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OsbI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31c7590b-5b9b-41bf-8472-02877d5bc502","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"手元にnetworkmanager-strongswanで接続しているmanjaro機があります","ts":"1622469666.413200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"im7S1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06d13f3b-7aa3-4b25-9586-72103b0e5a1a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"mtu小さくしてみたりしてるものの、改善の気配なし……。\n\nnetwork-managerでも接続に失敗したんですよね……。","ts":"1622469374.412900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tsurai_orange","count":2,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wvnjt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7561dfe3-0994-40fa-80d3-ccc291eaa092","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"network-manager は使わない？","ts":"1622469255.411600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/9i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fa367b4-799b-4ade-8131-009a0de32046","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Ubuntu だけど、この辺参考になるかも？","ts":"1622468963.411500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OB2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ea4de5a-4e73-4d5a-a6f9-d2c2831645af","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://www.osarusystem.com/misc/l2tp_ipsec_client.html\u003e","ts":"1622468952.411100","attachments":[{"fallback":"OsaruSystem: Ubuntu 20.04 へ L2TP/IPsec クライアントの構築","id":1,"title":"Ubuntu 20.04 へ L2TP/IPsec クライアントの構築","title_link":"https://www.osarusystem.com/misc/l2tp_ipsec_client.html","text":"Ubuntu 20.04 へ L2TP/IPsec クライアントを構築するために xl2tpd と strongSwan を導入します。","thumb_url":"https://www.osarusystem.com/image/thumbnail/ubuntu.png?2m2MdnS6NTd3Xu4a","blocks":null,"service_name":"OsaruSystem","thumb_width":200,"thumb_height":141,"from_url":"https://www.osarusystem.com/misc/l2tp_ipsec_client.html","original_url":"https://www.osarusystem.com/misc/l2tp_ipsec_client.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F8m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be807914-45a2-49b9-9c07-bf0b702a8394","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"l2tp は Linux で使うの、茨なんですよね…","ts":"1622468916.410700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U013SN4Q126"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fi5p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95d41cbb-7735-4661-b10e-47df1f73688a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"IPsec SA establishedでIPsecには成功してるから、次はL2TPの認証をしないといけなくて、そこでコケてるってことか。ちょっと理解。\narchwikiに従えば `echo \"c vpn-connection\" \u0026gt; /var/run/xl2tpd/l2tp-control` で認照できるはず……と。\nしかし権限がないので、\n```echo \"c vpn-connection\" | sudo tee /var/run/xl2tpd/l2tp-control\nsudo sh -c 'echo \"c vpn-connection\" \u0026gt; /var/run/xl2tpd/l2tp-control'```\nの2パターンを試したがpppが現れる気配がない……。","ts":"1622468676.410300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E/KvT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abe3f971-88fb-423c-b2fe-2781d387c65f","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"`/etc/ppp/options.l2tpd.client` のパスワードとか適当なのに書き換えても `ipsec auto --up` のメッセージが変わらないっていうことはユーザー認証に進めてない……？","ts":"1622467636.408400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x9CiW"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UGEQG12HJ","text":"\u003c@UGEQG12HJ\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622466874.408000","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"b126e681-b063-48f0-a83b-088be262a789","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"\u003c#CJMV3MSLR|question\u003e から移ってきました\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1622465551028700\u003e","ts":"1622465660.407600","attachments":[{"fallback":"[May 31st, 2021 5:52 AM] atusy7_slack: manjaroでL2TPのVPNを使いたく↓に従って設定しました。\n`ip verify`が通って、 `ipsec auto --up L2TP-PSK`は `IPsec SA established`を返す(スニペット参照)のですが、\n`ip link`を実行しても `ppp`から始まるdeviceが見つかりません……。何を見落としているのでしょうか。\n\u003chttps://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Openswan_L2TP/IPsec_VPN_client_setup\u003e","id":1,"author_id":"U022XK5866Q","author_name":"atusy","author_subname":"atusy","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U022XK5866Q","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2021-05-22/2117290589632_62893d816ac701f1f848_48.jpg","text":"manjaroでL2TPのVPNを使いたく↓に従って設定しました。\n`ip verify`が通って、 `ipsec auto --up L2TP-PSK`は `IPsec SA established`を返す(スニペット参照)のですが、\n`ip link`を実行しても `ppp`から始まるdeviceが見つかりません……。何を見落としているのでしょうか。\n\u003chttps://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Openswan_L2TP/IPsec_VPN_client_setup\u003e","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #question","ts":1622465551.028700,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1622465551028700","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1622465551028700"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p1Rt"}]}]
